NODE id=matrix/neo/internal/agent.Agent.cmRecordAssistant kind=method
  digest=b3:b7ac82d1c4410cce920798810943ebf5692d51fb3770d94dfa98e1887f063c17 file=neo/internal/agent/continuous.go range=58:89 lang=go exported=false byte_range=1828:2718
  sig=func (a *Agent) cmRecordAssistant(msg llm.Message)
  doc=cmRecordAssistant appends an assistant turn to the cortex transcript: its\ncontent (if any) as an assistant message, and each tool call as a tool_call\nmessage (name + canonical-JSON args, losslessly).
