NODE id=matrix/neo/internal/agent.Agent.cmRecordToolResult kind=method
  digest=b3:39c18723ab87b5778a0f923f0b06cc82cad65be1651ddc0576ccaec2e0085d85 file=neo/internal/agent/continuous.go range=91:104 lang=go exported=false byte_range=2720:3198
  sig=func (a *Agent) cmRecordToolResult(name, content string)
  doc=cmRecordToolResult appends a tool result to the cortex transcript. cortex\nspills an oversized tool_result to a resolvable ref on its own (the overflow\ndiscipline lives in session.go), so the full content is handed over.
