  doc=emitMemory hands the harness a legible summary of this turn's activation\nbundle so the client can show the memory Neo carries (task 7.1). Pure\nside-channel: it reads the already-computed read-only bundle, mutates nothing,\nand is a no-op when no observer is wired or there is nothing to show.
EDGES
  ^contains=matrix/neo/internal/agent.Agent
  ^defines=matrix/neo/internal/agent/continuous.go

