  doc=evalCloseChain walks the ordered chain and returns the first firing guard's\nname and decision. The terminal deliver guard always fires, so every\nevaluation produces a decision. Contract — mutates: whatever the ONE firing\nguard mutates (transcript nudges, the unproductive counter, cc.answer);\nnon-firing guards are side-effect free.
EDGES
  ^contains=matrix/neo/internal/agent.Agent
  ^defines=matrix/neo/internal/agent/closechain.go

