  sig=func (a *Agent) premiseRefute(p *Premise, citation string)
  doc=premiseRefute marks a premise refuted (the check contradicted it) and\nre-renders. A refuted premise forces a plan-revision step before further\ndependent dispatches (enforced at the gate, task 3.1).
EDGES
