  sig=func isHeartbeatWake(userInput string) bool
  doc=isHeartbeatWake reports whether the user input is a Chronos heartbeat wake —\ni.e. it carries the HEARTBEAT marker that distinguishes a proactive review\nturn from a normal user message.
