NODE id=matrix/neo/internal/agent.overflowStore.put kind=method
  digest=b3:032d2d5e3649931fb1894d06744f91ba42c2340f0e17aa6a2871b4d6290768b6 file=neo/internal/agent/overflow.go range=60:85 lang=go exported=false byte_range=2338:3159
  sig=func (s *overflowStore) put(content string) (token string, path string, ok bool)
  doc=put writes content to a fresh run-scoped file and returns its token. On any\nfilesystem error it returns ok=false so the caller falls back to plain\nhead+tail truncation (graceful degradation — a bounded transcript beats a\ncrash).
